<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-D.Jones to open new Melbourne store.</title>
<headline>RTRS-D.Jones to open new Melbourne store.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian department store chain David Jones Ltd said on Thursday it would open a new store in South Eastern Melbourne.</p>
<p>The new store would be completed in the 1998/99 financial year and be part of Westfield Holdings Ltd's Fountain Gate complex, David Jones said.  </p>
<p>The new store would be of a similar size to the two-level 15,000-square metre Glen Waverley store.</p>
<p>Work on the new Fountain Gate complex would start next year.</p>
<p>Westfield said the shopping centre would include a 10-screen Village Roadshow Ltd movie complex.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
